$$
\begin{aligned}
4 x+\left(6 y\right)\frac{dy}{dx}&=0 \\
\left(6 y\right)\frac{dy}{dx}&=-\left(4 x\right) \\
\frac{dy}{dx}&=-\frac{4 x}{6 y}
\end{aligned}
$$

Evaluate the tangent slope at the given point:

$$
m_{\mathrm{t}}=-\frac{12}{18}=- \frac{2}{3}
$$

The tangent line uses $m=- \frac{2}{3}$.

Use the given point and this slope:

$$
\begin{aligned}
y-\left(3\right)&=- \frac{2}{3}\left(x-\left(3\right)\right) \\
y&=- \frac{2}{3}\left(x-\left(3\right)\right)+\left(3\right)
\end{aligned}
$$

At the $y$-axis, $x=0$. Substitute and simplify:

$$
\begin{aligned}
y&=- \frac{2}{3}\left(0-\left(3\right)\right)+\left(3\right) \\
y&=5
\end{aligned}
$$

Therefore $P=\left(0,5\right)$."] [:db/add "29cb5437-699d-5aaf-9a62-4154c1c9021d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "29cb5437-699d-5aaf-9a62-4154c1c9021d" :question/answer-fields "5d1aed36-4ca6-5b73-ac7d-33356fc15e04"] [:db/ensure "29cb5437-699d-5aaf-9a62-4154c1c9021d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186054847 :knowledge-point/questions "29cb5437-699d-5aaf-9a62-4154c1c9021d"] [:db/add "8b9ac18c-6cb1-5ee4-b2ae-85e778c2a695" :answer/id #uuid "8b9ac18c-6cb1-5ee4-b2ae-85e778c2a695"] [:db/add "8b9ac18c-6cb1-5ee4-b2ae-85e778c2a695" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8b9ac18c-6cb1-5ee4-b2ae-85e778c2a695" :answer/value "\left(-1,0\right)"] [:db/ensure "8b9ac18c-6cb1-5ee4-b2ae-85e778c2a695" :answer/validate] [:db/add "94c95d14-b867-5ca7-a53b-0023220ab117" :answer/id #uuid "94c95d14-b867-5ca7-a53b-0023220ab117"] [:db/add "94c95d14-b867-5ca7-a53b-0023220ab117" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "94c95d14-b867-5ca7-a53b-0023220ab117" :answer/value "\left(5,0\right)"] [:db/ensure "94c95d14-b867-5ca7-a53b-0023220ab117" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ce5be1e9-231e-5382-91f8-46e87df3234c" :answer/id #uuid "ce5be1e9-231e-5382-91f8-46e87df3234c"] [:db/add "ce5be1e9-231e-5382-91f8-46e87df3234c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ce5be1e9-231e-5382-91f8-46e87df3234c" :answer/value "\left(11,0\right)"] [:db/ensure "ce5be1e9-231e-5382-91f8-46e87df3234c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a16893dd-7f2e-5ac3-9e44-6880f0379a03" :answer/id #uuid "a16893dd-7f2e-5ac3-9e44-6880f0379a03"] [:db/add "a16893dd-7f2e-5ac3-9e44-6880f0379a03" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a16893dd-7f2e-5ac3-9e44-6880f0379a03" :answer/value "\left(\frac{21}{4},0\right)"] [:db/ensure "a16893dd-7f2e-5ac3-9e44-6880f0379a03" :answer/validate] [:db/add "91d14913-9638-5ab9-8438-f64ab31f6aa6" :answer/id #uuid "91d14913-9638-5ab9-8438-f64ab31f6aa6"] [:db/add "91d14913-9638-5ab9-8438-f64ab31f6aa6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "91d14913-9638-5ab9-8438-f64ab31f6aa6" :answe